ations Brand Western Sydney University Location Parramatta Business Unit Data (U76A) Contract Type Full-Time Position Category Professional Description Full-time, ongoing positionBased at Western’s Parramatta South campusSalary: HEW Level 7 $108,659 – $117,202 per annum, plus 17% Super and Leave LoadingShape and implement strategies that strengthen d Reference e7b047f8-911b-4942-9fc6-3642219bbd0b Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Clinical Trials Manager Salary Location Campbelltown, AU Division Provost Brand Western Sydney University Location Campbelltown Business Unit Faculty of Health (U73M) Contract Type Full-Time Position Category Professional Description Full-time, 2 Years Fixed-Term position at HEW Level 8.Campbelltown campus with flexible working arrangements.Salary: $120,754 – $134,051 per annum, plus 17% Super and Leave Loading.Lead the Faculty’s Reference e79659b3-440d-431b-a92f-f1587fe778fc Expiry Date 01/01/0001 Read more Shortlist Read more Shortlist Apply"
